  "description": "To most people, being called “cute” is a compliment…but to U-Ju, it’s just about the worst thing imaginable! Haunted by his adorability even in adulthood, U-Ju puts up a barrier pretending to be a badass so that he won’t have to hear the dreaded ‘C’ word any longer. But this facade can only last so long when Koh Han-Gyeol asks him to prove just bad he can be - in the bedroom!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
